## Container View (C4 Level 2)

```mermaid
graph TD
    Main[Main Agent] -->|plan / execute / simplify / review| Tools[Tools Layer: tools.py]
    Tools -->|ctx.dispatch_tool delegate_task| Sub[Subagent Process]
    Sub -->|subagent_stop hook| Hooks[Hooks Layer: hooks.py]
    Hooks -->|advance| State[State Machine: state.py]
    State -->|load_state / save_state| SF[(jovaltus_state.json)]
    Prompts[Prompts: prompts/*.md] -->|goal text| Sub
    Skills[Bundled Skills x5] -->|guide| Main
```

| Container | Technology | Purpose |
|-----------|-----------|---------|
| Tools Layer | `tools.py` | 4 tool handlers: `plan`, `execute`, `simplify`, `review` — each dispatches subagents via `ctx.dispatch_tool("delegate_task", ...)` |
| Hooks Layer | `hooks.py` | `subagent_start` / `subagent_stop` / `pre_llm_call` — associate children with the pipeline and advance the state machine |
| State Machine | `state.py` | Deterministic phase transitions (`prd → research → acceptance → tasks` for plan; simplify/review verdict loops); JSON persistence for cross-session resume |
| Prompts | `prompts/*.md` | Subagent goal prompts: `prd`, `research`, `acceptance`, `tasks`, `execute`, `simplify-review`, `simplify-fix`, `review`, `review-fix` |
| Bundled Skills | Markdown (SKILL.md) | 5 utility skills: `manage-git-repo`, `manage-agents-md`, `project-documentation`, `agentic-debugging`, `qa` |

