## Find It Fast

```bash
grep -rn "register_tool" src/          # Tool registration
grep -rn "register_hook" src/          # Hook registration
ls src/jovaltus/prompts/               # Subagent goal prompts
ls src/jovaltus/skills/                # Bundled skills
```
